<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (Tibetan-first independent proposal); source wording remains verbatim. The opening claim, embedded quotation and following opponent's inference retain distinct source roles. The authorial mdzad pa is omitted because the English In his Commentary supplies ownership while makes this statement recasts the later quotation report. gsungs pa/de own statement/this in the later this statement would clause. The three Tibetan rnag occurrences own the two quotation occurrences and final real pus; the preceding English the pus is is an unwrapped reprise of that final Tibetan referent. dbang/gis distinguishes the lexical forced from the separately expressed instrumental through, which introduces the ripening of their karma. The med negation owns only not; existential auxiliaries remain unwrapped. mi 'thad par is a d3 whole for mistaken, with no invented positive member.</div>
